1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:01,547
Spot the error.

2
00:00:01,587 --> 00:00:04,680
A classic CSS
and PMS pattern.

3
00:00:08,403 --> 00:00:09,673
There
are actually two

4
00:00:09,713 --> 00:00:10,669
mistakes here,

5
00:00:10,709 --> 00:00:12,929
and one logic
fixes both.

6
00:00:13,570 --> 00:00:15,571
Information
is abstract.

7
00:00:15,611 --> 00:00:17,600
Facts, news,
details:

8
00:00:17,640 --> 00:00:18,969
you can’t hold
information

9
00:00:19,009 --> 00:00:19,841
in your hand,

10
00:00:19,881 --> 00:00:21,235
and you can’t
count it.

11
00:00:21,275 --> 00:00:22,533
So it’s
uncountable:

12
00:00:22,573 --> 00:00:23,545
no s.

13
00:00:23,585 --> 00:00:25,968
Information,
never informations.

14
00:00:26,603 --> 00:00:28,215
And because it’s
uncountable,

15
00:00:28,255 --> 00:00:29,723
it works
as one whole,

16
00:00:29,763 --> 00:00:31,849
so the verb
is singular too:

17
00:00:31,889 --> 00:00:33,385
was, not were.

18
00:00:34,037 --> 00:00:35,702
‘The information
provided by

19
00:00:35,742 --> 00:00:38,061
the officer was
not accurate.’

20
00:00:38,101 --> 00:00:39,085
Need a number?

21
00:00:39,125 --> 00:00:41,035
Say a piece
of information.

22
00:00:41,970 --> 00:00:43,631
Logic, not rules.

23
00:00:43,671 --> 00:00:45,824
Comment ‘logic’
for the next one.

